 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n    <meta name=\"csrf-token\" content=\"1795679561:meb5u2++j/YWwQY289Kmqyq4Dbn7h18FIrG2tYa3IEA=\">\n    <meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\">\n    <script>\n        window.__feInitLocalTime = new Date().getTime() / 1000;\n        window.__feConfigVersion = '74d532c6c7861bfe'; window.__feConfigRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/config'; window.__fePhoneHomeCall = 'https\\u003A\\/\\/moshimoshi\\u003Aagltb3noatpwohhuenb5ag1tc2jsnnl3\\u0040errtrack.luogu.com.cn\\/lotlp1';        window.__luoguTagVersion = 'zh\\u002DCN\\/2026112514'; window.__luoguTagRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/tags';\n    </script>\n    <title>题解 P1075 【质因数分解】 - 洛谷专栏</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/favicon.ico\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline' luogu.com *.luogu.com luogu.com.cn *.luogu.com.cn luogu.org *.luogu.org wss: blob: luoguprivate.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com luogu.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.dun.163yun.com https://*.dun.163.com https://*.nosdn.126.net https://*.nosdn.127.net https://nos.netease.com https://cstaticdun.126.net https://cstaticdun1.126.net https://cstaticdun-v6.126.net https://acstatic-dun.126.net; img-src * data:; font-src * data:; worker-src data: blob:; frame-src https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn https://player.bilibili.com https://www.bilibili.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com\">\n        <script id=\"lentille-context\" type=\"application/json\">{\"instance\":\"main\",\"template\":\"article.show\",\"status\":200,\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"data\":{\"article\":{\"lid\":\"rjjud4hi\",\"title\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3 P1075 \\u3010\\u8d28\\u56e0\\u6570\\u5206\\u89e3\\u3011\",\"category\":2,\"time\":1561879525,\"author\":{\"uid\":212267,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/212267.png\",\"name\":\"Stephen_Curry\",\"slogan\":\"\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Blue\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"\"},\"upvote\":6480,\"replyCount\":373,\"favorCount\":3,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1075\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"[NOIP 2012 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u8d28\\u56e0\\u6570\\u5206\\u89e3\",\"difficulty\":2,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":0,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"\\u8fd9\\u9898\\u771f\\u7684\\u4e0d\\u96be\\uff0c\\u53ea\\u4e0d\\u8fc7\\u6570\\u636e\\u70b9\\u6709\\u70b9\\u5751\\uff0c\\u56e0\\u6b64\\u8981\\u591a\\u591a\\u7559\\u610f\\uff08\\u5c0f\\u5fc3\\uff01\\uff01\\uff01\\uff09\\n\\n\\u5927\\u591a\\u6570\\u4eba\\u9996\\u5148\\u60f3\\u5230\\u7684\\u5c31\\u662ffor\\u5faa\\u73af\\u4ece(n - 1)\\u4e00\\u76f4\\u679a\\u4e3e\\u4e0b\\u53bb\\uff0c\\u8d34\\u4ee3\\u7801\\uff1a\\n\\n```\\n#include \\u003Cbits\\/stdc++.h\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\nint main() {\\n    int n;\\n    cin \\u003E\\u003E n;\\n    for (int i = n - 1; i \\u003E= 2; i--) if (n % i == 0) { \\n        cout \\u003C\\u003C i;\\n        break;\\n    }\\n    return 0;\\n}\\n```\\n\\u53ef\\u662f\\u8fd9\\u6837\\u7684[\\u7ed3\\u679c](https:\\/\\/www.luogu.org\\/recordnew\\/show\\/20168306)\\u662f... ...\\n\\n\\u6709\\u4eba\\u8bf4\\uff0c\\u5176\\u5b9e\\u6ca1\\u5fc5\\u8981\\u679a\\u4e3e\\u52302\\uff0c\\u679a\\u4e3e\\u5230n\\u7684\\u5e73\\u65b9\\u6839\\u5c31\\u884c\\u4e86\\u3002\\n\\n\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u89c1\\u4e0b\\uff1a\\n\\n```\\n#include \\u003Cbits\\/stdc++.h\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\nint main() {\\n    int n;\\n    cin \\u003E\\u003E n;\\n    for (int i = n - 1; i \\u003E sqrt(n); i--) if (n % i == 0) { \\n        cout \\u003C\\u003C i;\\n        break;\\n    }\\n    return 0;\\n}\\n```\\n\\u7136\\u9e45[\\u7ed3\\u679c](https:\\/\\/www.luogu.org\\/recordnew\\/show\\/20168411)\\u4e5f\\u5e76\\u4e0d\\u5c3d\\u5982\\u4eba\\u610f... ...\\n\\n\\u5176\\u5b9e\\u8fd8\\u6709\\u4e00\\u79cd\\u66f4\\u7b80\\u4fbf\\u7684\\u65b9\\u6cd5\\uff01\\n\\n\\u5927\\u5bb6\\u5e94\\u8be5\\u77e5\\u9053\\uff0c\\u7ea6\\u6570\\u662f\\u6210\\u5bf9\\u51fa\\u73b0\\u7684\\uff08\\u5e73\\u65b9\\u6570\\u9664\\u5916\\uff09\\uff0c\\u4e5f\\u5c31\\u662f\\u8bf4\\uff0c\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u6570\\u7684\\u7b2c\\u4e00\\u5c0f\\u7ea6\\u6570\\u4e58\\u7b2c\\u4e00\\u5927\\u7ea6\\u6570\\u76f8\\u4e58\\u7b49\\u4e8e\\u8fd9\\u4e2a\\u6570\\uff0c\\u7b2c\\u4e8c\\u5c0f\\u7ea6\\u6570\\u4e58\\u7b2c\\u4e8c\\u5927\\u7ea6\\u6570\\u76f8\\u4e58\\u4e5f\\u4f9d\\u7136\\u7b49\\u4e8e\\u8fd9\\u4e2a\\u6570\\uff01\\n\\n\\u56e0\\u6b64\\uff0c\\u53ea\\u8981\\u627e\\u51fan\\u7684\\u6700\\u5c0f\\u7ea6\\u6570\\uff081\\u9664\\u5916\\uff09\\uff0c\\u518d\\u7528n\\u9664\\u4ee5\\u8fd9\\u4e2a\\u6570\\uff0c\\u5c31\\u80fd\\u5f97\\u5230\\u7ed3\\u679c\\u4e86\\uff01\\n\\n\\u8d34\\u4e0a\\u4ee3\\u7801\\uff1a\\n\\n```\\n#include \\u003Cbits\\/stdc++.h\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\nint main() {\\n    int n;\\n    cin \\u003E\\u003E n;\\n    for (int i = 2; i \\u003C= n; i++) if (n % i == 0) { \\n        cout \\u003C\\u003C n \\/ i;\\n        break;\\n    }\\n    return 0;\\n}\\n```\\n\\u7ec8\\u4e8e\\u901a\\u8fc7\\u4e86... ...\\n\\n\\u5176\\u5b9e\\uff0c\\u4e2d\\u95f4\\u7684for\\u5faa\\u73af\\u4e5f\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u6539\\u6210while\\u5faa\\u73af\\uff0c\\u6838\\u5fc3\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u89c1\\u4e0b\\uff1a\\n\\n```\\nwhile (i \\u003C= sqrt(n)) {\\n\\tif (n % i == 0) break;\\n\\ti++;\\n}\\ncout \\u003C\\u003C n \\/ i;\\n```\\n# \\u8fd9\\u7bc7\\u9898\\u89e3\\u6216\\u8bb8\\u4e0d\\u600e\\u4e48\\u5b8c\\u7f8e\\uff0c\\u4f46\\u4f60\\u770b\\u5f97\\u5982\\u6b64\\u8ba4\\u771f\\uff0c\\u5c31\\u4e0d\\u80fd\\u70b9\\u4e2a\\u8d5e\\u518d\\u8d70\\u4e48\\uff1f\",\"categoryOld\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795593161.27267}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/rjjud4hi\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3 P1075 \\u3010\\u8d28\\u56e0\\u6570\\u5206\\u89e3\\u3011\",\"description\":\"\\u8fd9\\u9898\\u771f\\u7684\\u4e0d\\u96be\\uff0c\\u53ea\\u4e0d\\u8fc7\\u6570\\u636e\\u70b9\\u6709\\u70b9\\u5751\\uff0c\\u56e0\\u6b64\\u8981\\u591a\\u591a\\u7559\\u610f\\uff08\\u5c0f\\u5fc3\\uff01\\uff01\\uff01\\uff09\\n\\u5927\\u591a\\u6570\\u4eba\\u9996\\u5148\\u60f3\\u5230\\u7684\\u5c31\\u662ffor\\u5faa\\u73af\\u4ece(n - 1)\\u4e00\\u76f4\\u679a\\u4e3e\\u4e0b\\u53bb\\uff0c\\u8d34\\u4ee3\\u7801\\uff1a\\n#include &lt;bits\\/stdc++.h&gt;\\nusing namespace std;\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Stephen_Curry\"},\"datePublished\":\"2019-06-30T15:25:25+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"题解 P1075 【质因数分解】\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"这题真的不难，只不过数据点有点坑，因此要多多留意（小心！！！）\n大多数人首先想到的就是for循环从(n - 1)一直枚举下去，贴代码：\n#include &amp;lt;bits/stdc++.h&amp;gt;\nusing namespace std;…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"Stephen_Curry\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2019-06-30T15:25:25+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/rjjud4hi\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解 P1075 【质因数分解】</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">Stephen_Curry</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2019-06-30T15:25:25+08:00\">2019-06-30 15:25:25</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>这题真的不难，只不过数据点有点坑，因此要多多留意（小心！！！）</p>\n<p>大多数人首先想到的就是for循环从(n - 1)一直枚举下去，贴代码：</p>\n<pre><code>#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nint main() {\n    int n;\n    cin &gt;&gt; n;\n    for (int i = n - 1; i &gt;= 2; i--) if (n % i == 0) { \n        cout &lt;&lt; i;\n        break;\n    }\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>\n<p>可是这样的结果是... ...</p>\n<p>有人说，其实没必要枚举到2，枚举到n的平方根就行了。</p>\n<p>代码见下：</p>\n<pre><code>#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nint main() {\n    int n;\n    cin &gt;&gt; n;\n    for (int i = n - 1; i &gt; sqrt(n); i--) if (n % i == 0) { \n        cout &lt;&lt; i;\n        break;\n    }\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>\n<p>然鹅结果也并不尽如人意... ...</p>\n<p>其实还有一种更简便的方法！</p>\n<p>大家应该知道，约数是成对出现的（平方数除外），也就是说，一个数的第一小约数乘第一大约数相乘等于这个数，第二小约数乘第二大约数相乘也依然等于这个数！</p>\n<p>因此，只要找出n的最小约数（1除外），再用n除以这个数，就能得到结果了！</p>\n<p>贴上代码：</p>\n<pre><code>#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nint main() {\n    int n;\n    cin &gt;&gt; n;\n    for (int i = 2; i &lt;= n; i++) if (n % i == 0) { \n        cout &lt;&lt; n / i;\n        break;\n    }\n    return 0;\n}</code></pre>\n<p>终于通过了... ...</p>\n<p>其实，中间的for循环也可以改成while循环，核心代码见下：</p>\n<pre><code>while (i &lt;= sqrt(n)) {\n    if (n % i == 0) break;\n    i++;\n}\ncout &lt;&lt; n / i;</code></pre>\n<h1>这篇题解或许不怎么完美，但你看得如此认真，就不能点个赞再走么？</h1>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a5ff13491cf4f29d',t:'MTc5NTU5MzE2MQ=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a5ff13491cf4f29d',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
